1
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:07,080
[Fragments of Truth]

2
00:01:07,080 --> 00:01:08,640
[Episode 2]

3
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:20,150
Xiaobei.

4
00:02:20,750 --> 00:02:21,120
Mm.

5
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,400
Go do your homework in the back.

6
00:02:22,520 --> 00:02:23,000
Okay.

7
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,310
This is Zou Jun's child.

8
00:02:32,150 --> 00:02:32,360
Mm.

9
00:02:42,750 --> 00:02:43,870
I grew up in the countryside.

10
00:02:44,590 --> 00:02:46,470
I came to the city with him
when I was 19.

11
00:02:48,590 --> 00:02:49,590
Not long afterward,

12
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,710
he forced me to earn money for him.

13
00:02:52,910 --> 00:02:53,960
How did he make you earn money?

14
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:00,800
By sleeping with men.

15
00:03:02,150 --> 00:03:03,310
If I refused,

16
00:03:03,800 --> 00:03:04,590
he would beat me.

17
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,840
Later, I became pregnant with his child.

18
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:08,430
Only then did he stop.

19
00:03:10,960 --> 00:03:11,800
You never called the police?

20
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,840
I was young back then,

21
00:03:14,630 --> 00:03:15,400
and I had no money.

22
00:03:17,430 --> 00:03:18,840
I feared my child would have no father.

23
00:03:20,840 --> 00:03:22,280
If Xiaobei hadn't come along,

24
00:03:22,430 --> 00:03:23,150
I'd have killed him.

25
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:25,910
When did you last see him?

26
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,280
About half a year ago.

27
00:03:31,750 --> 00:03:32,910
He never came to see his child.

28
00:03:34,280 --> 00:03:35,560
He used to cause trouble.

29
00:03:36,910 --> 00:03:38,710
Maybe he found his conscience
these past two years.

30
00:03:39,840 --> 00:03:40,560
He had a change of heart.

31
00:03:40,800 --> 00:03:42,430
He knew

32
00:03:44,080 --> 00:03:44,630
he shouldn't interfere
with his child's life.

33
00:03:44,960 --> 00:03:46,120
He even paid support a few times.

34
00:03:48,520 --> 00:03:48,750
Oh.

35
00:03:48,960 --> 00:03:49,400
Right.

36
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:50,560
Yesterday,

37
00:03:50,800 --> 00:03:52,800
he had someone deliver
20,000 yuan in cash.

38
00:03:53,800 --> 00:03:54,360
Yesterday,

39
00:03:56,280 --> 00:03:57,360
near closing time,

40
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:58,680
a woman brought it.

41
00:04:08,240 --> 00:04:08,590
Thanks.

42
00:04:40,630 --> 00:04:41,240
Hao Jun.

43
00:04:41,430 --> 00:04:42,560
You said you'd checked everything.

44
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:43,720
You missed a pinhole camera.

45
00:04:43,750 --> 00:04:45,830
These neighboring units are mine.

46
00:04:53,750 --> 00:04:54,070
Boss.

47
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:55,040
Oh.

48
00:04:55,310 --> 00:04:55,630
Sir...

49
00:04:55,830 --> 00:04:56,800
There you are.

50
00:04:57,600 --> 00:04:58,040
Open it.

51
00:05:47,360 --> 00:05:48,360
You almost got away with it.

52
00:05:49,310 --> 00:05:49,720
Talk.

53
00:05:50,560 --> 00:05:51,560
I had no idea

54
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:54,390
Zou Jun was doing that on my property.

55
00:05:54,630 --> 00:05:55,750
He was just a tenant.

56
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:57,000
You weren't close, huh?

57
00:05:59,430 --> 00:05:59,630
Here.

58
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:00,750
Take a look at this.

59
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,630
This is yours, right?

60
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,040
Look familiar?

61
00:06:05,630 --> 00:06:08,070
The room was listed online
for 200 yuan a night,

62
00:06:09,270 --> 00:06:10,720
yet he sent you 10,000 yuan.

63
00:06:11,190 --> 00:06:11,560
Pricey.

64
00:06:11,630 --> 00:06:11,800
Hey!

65
00:06:12,070 --> 00:06:12,480
All right.

66
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:13,360
Spit it out.

67
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:17,240
You dared hide a murder from us?

68
00:06:17,870 --> 00:06:18,310
Right?

69
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:20,950
If I have to say it for you,

70
00:06:20,950 --> 00:06:21,600
it'll be too late.

71
00:06:22,720 --> 00:06:23,040
Wait, wait.

72
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,120
Don't do that.

73
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:26,120
I knew him well.

74
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:30,040
But his death had nothing to do with me.

75
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:32,070
That's not for you to decide.

76
00:06:33,560 --> 00:06:34,190
Well,

77
00:06:35,190 --> 00:06:36,310
we have to go back to last year.

78
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:39,870
Donglin Night Market went viral
online, didn't it?

79
00:06:40,630 --> 00:06:41,560
So I thought

80
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,800
I'd open a guesthouse

81
00:06:44,390 --> 00:06:45,120
for tourists.

82
00:06:45,310 --> 00:06:47,070
I didn't expect the hype to rise so fast

83
00:06:47,430 --> 00:06:48,160
and fade just as quickly.

84
00:06:48,360 --> 00:06:49,270
I didn't make any money

85
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,430
and lost plenty.

86
00:06:50,950 --> 00:06:53,270
Between the rent and renovations,

87
00:06:53,630 --> 00:06:55,190
plus utilities and everything else...

88
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:56,600
Enough.

89
00:06:58,310 --> 00:06:59,720
You're not here for idle chatter.

90
00:07:01,430 --> 00:07:02,070
Get to the point.

91
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:04,310
Then later,

92
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:06,430
Zou Jun showed up

93
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:08,000
and became a regular.

94
00:07:08,630 --> 00:07:11,630
He brought different women each time.

95
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:13,120
I was just curious.

96
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,270
Men get curious.

97
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,510
I'd chat him up now and then.

98
00:07:17,830 --> 00:07:18,310
One day,

99
00:07:18,310 --> 00:07:20,310
I found that in his room,

100
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:21,800
a camera had been installed.

101
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:25,040
Man, either compensate me,

102
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,120
or we're calling the police.

103
00:07:27,510 --> 00:07:28,000
Look,

104
00:07:28,270 --> 00:07:29,630
I may have my quirks,

105
00:07:30,070 --> 00:07:30,800
but this is going too far.

106
00:07:31,630 --> 00:07:32,800
If you push me,

107
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,360
it won't end well.

108
00:07:35,040 --> 00:07:35,630
Don't try that.

109
00:07:36,630 --> 00:07:37,310
Fine, no cops.

110
00:07:38,000 --> 00:07:38,240
Pay up.

111
00:07:40,560 --> 00:07:40,920
How much?

112
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:43,160
500.

113
00:07:43,750 --> 00:07:43,950
Fine.

114
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,280
[Transfer: 10,000 yuan]

115
00:07:50,310 --> 00:07:50,560
Hmm.

116
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:52,000
You.

117
00:07:52,360 --> 00:07:53,040
What do you mean?

118
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,560
I want this room.

119
00:07:56,310 --> 00:07:58,120
Starting today,
I'll pay you this amount every month.

120
00:07:59,160 --> 00:07:59,870
I'll give you the money.

121
00:07:59,870 --> 00:08:01,430
But don't meddle in what I do.

122
00:08:02,920 --> 00:08:03,510
Listen.

123
00:08:04,190 --> 00:08:05,830
I have no idea what this thing is.

124
00:08:06,510 --> 00:08:07,720
Even if they catch you,

125
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:08,800
it's not my problem.

126
00:08:10,430 --> 00:08:12,830
He called it 'tanhua,'
secretly filming women for porn.

127
00:08:13,950 --> 00:08:16,830
He'd pick out attractive women himself

128
00:08:17,830 --> 00:08:18,830
and film sex videos.

129
00:08:19,830 --> 00:08:21,630
Then he'd sell them to porn sites.

130
00:08:23,360 --> 00:08:25,600
Were those girls registered?

131
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:27,040
That's on me.

132
00:08:27,600 --> 00:08:28,390
I took a shortcut.

133
00:08:29,190 --> 00:08:29,870
I was wrong.

134
00:08:30,310 --> 00:08:31,270
I'll accept the penalty.

135
00:08:33,030 --> 00:08:33,440
The video?

136
00:08:33,790 --> 00:08:33,960
Where?

137
00:08:35,080 --> 00:08:36,270
They're internet-connected cameras.

138
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:37,150
They either stream live

139
00:08:37,790 --> 00:08:39,840
or save the footage to the cloud
for editing.

140
00:08:40,390 --> 00:08:40,750
But...

141
00:08:41,320 --> 00:08:43,080
Later, he added me to a group

142
00:08:43,840 --> 00:08:46,200
that charged people for access.

143
00:08:58,440 --> 00:08:59,960
We checked every member in the group.

144
00:09:00,510 --> 00:09:02,150
One was from Lingnan Province.

145
00:09:03,480 --> 00:09:05,390
He purchased access
to this camera's livestream.

146
00:09:05,790 --> 00:09:07,510
Local police summoned him
for questioning.

147
00:09:07,790 --> 00:09:08,320
He confessed.

148
00:09:12,910 --> 00:09:14,750
He opened the livestreaming app
on his computer

149
00:09:14,960 --> 00:09:15,960
and happened to see the killing.

150
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:18,320
At first, he thought it was role-play,

151
00:09:19,200 --> 00:09:20,720
until the attacker actually stabbed him.

152
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,240
Terrified, he shut off the livestream.

153
00:09:22,550 --> 00:09:24,320
He was ashamed
of what he'd been watching,

154
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:25,600
so he kept quiet.

155
00:09:28,080 --> 00:09:30,080
The video never shows
a frontal view of her face.

156
00:09:34,440 --> 00:09:34,960
Han Ning.

157
00:09:35,390 --> 00:09:36,550
How did you know

158
00:09:36,550 --> 00:09:38,630
Zou Jun installed the camera himself?

159
00:09:40,030 --> 00:09:40,790
Most people

160
00:09:40,790 --> 00:09:42,440
try to survive when they're in danger.

161
00:09:42,630 --> 00:09:45,200
They instinctively move
toward doors or windows.

162
00:09:45,720 --> 00:09:47,550
But the evidence at the scene shows

163
00:09:47,600 --> 00:09:50,000
Zou Jun kept trying to lure the attacker

164
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,030
toward the camera.

165
00:09:52,030 --> 00:09:53,790
That means he knew the camera was there.

166
00:09:56,030 --> 00:09:57,270
Zou Jun's ex-wife confirmed it too.

167
00:09:58,030 --> 00:10:00,510
The woman in the video
delivered the money.

168
00:10:01,720 --> 00:10:05,390
Zou Jun likely meant the 20,000 yuan
to repay Xu Haodong.

169
00:10:06,150 --> 00:10:07,550
Why would the attacker do that?

170
00:10:08,550 --> 00:10:10,510
Someone capable of such brutality

171
00:10:10,840 --> 00:10:12,910
can't be acting out of guilt, right?

172
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,600
It's actually possible.

173
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:20,510
The method was cruel,

174
00:10:20,910 --> 00:10:22,320
but she hadn't lost her reason.

175
00:10:23,550 --> 00:10:25,120
I believe she did it deliberately.

176
00:10:26,150 --> 00:10:27,510
The wounds to his genitals,

177
00:10:27,750 --> 00:10:29,790
together with the motifs
of cosmetic surgery and makeup,

178
00:10:30,120 --> 00:10:34,000
seem to symbolize

179
00:10:34,000 --> 00:10:36,440
the harm most women endure
in today's society.

180
00:10:37,750 --> 00:10:38,550
The victim's ex-wife

181
00:10:38,550 --> 00:10:41,000
was also a woman who had suffered abuse.

182
00:10:43,200 --> 00:10:44,390
You mean

183
00:10:45,320 --> 00:10:45,840
empathy?

184
00:10:47,270 --> 00:10:47,510
Yes.

185
00:10:48,440 --> 00:10:49,550
Rather than guilt,

186
00:10:49,840 --> 00:10:50,360
I believe

187
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:53,120
the killer has exceptional empathy.

188
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:55,790
What she did

189
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:58,480
was a revenge ritual

190
00:10:58,960 --> 00:10:59,600
against men.

191
00:11:03,520 --> 00:11:05,320
[Hongyuan Phone Repair]

192
00:11:22,750 --> 00:11:23,750
Ah.

193
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:26,360
What?

194
00:11:29,000 --> 00:11:29,440
Why are you here?

195
00:11:30,120 --> 00:11:30,960
What am I doing here?

196
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,480
I came to see if you were alive.

197
00:11:33,200 --> 00:11:33,630
Ha-ha.

198
00:11:34,480 --> 00:11:35,080
How's business?

199
00:11:36,360 --> 00:11:37,080
Pretty good.

200
00:11:37,390 --> 00:11:39,270
Good? Do you see a single customer here?

201
00:11:40,240 --> 00:11:40,510
Huh?

202
00:11:42,790 --> 00:11:43,510
Come work with me.

203
00:11:43,870 --> 00:11:44,200
I'll help.

204
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,080
I'm good.

205
00:11:48,440 --> 00:11:49,200
My business is doing fine.

206
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:52,270
Stop getting in the way of my business.

207
00:11:56,790 --> 00:11:57,630
A-Jun's dead.

208
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,440
This is his phone.

209
00:12:01,270 --> 00:12:01,750
Unlock it.

210
00:12:05,550 --> 00:12:05,790
Hey...

211
00:12:07,080 --> 00:12:09,790
What are you doing?

212
00:12:13,790 --> 00:12:14,120
Dongzi.

213
00:12:15,870 --> 00:12:16,550
I'm not young anymore.

214
00:12:18,320 --> 00:12:19,120
Stop hassling me.

215
00:12:20,240 --> 00:12:20,480
Okay?

216
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:28,320
Take it.

217
00:12:34,240 --> 00:12:35,000
It's for you.

218
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:37,390
Don't ask me again
what this wine tastes like.

219
00:13:01,200 --> 00:13:01,840
Turn the music off.

220
00:13:03,030 --> 00:13:04,120
Hey, go on.

221
00:13:04,600 --> 00:13:06,360
Bring Brother Dong some fruit
to help him sober up.

222
00:13:08,270 --> 00:13:08,630
Brother Dong.

223
00:13:09,750 --> 00:13:11,120
Still thinking about Lao Zou's death?

224
00:13:12,720 --> 00:13:15,200
Every time I close my eyes,
I see his dead face.

225
00:13:15,240 --> 00:13:17,120
What rotten luck.

226
00:13:18,270 --> 00:13:19,030
Who did this?

227
00:13:19,030 --> 00:13:20,440
How would I know?

228
00:13:21,120 --> 00:13:22,360
I told him a long time ago

229
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:24,150
his lust would get him killed someday.

230
00:13:24,270 --> 00:13:25,600
Now he's got nothing left down there.

231
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,600
They cut it all off.

232
00:13:26,600 --> 00:13:28,510
Yeah. You didn't see the scene.

233
00:13:28,870 --> 00:13:30,600
Anyone else would've been scared stiff.

234
00:13:31,030 --> 00:13:31,510
That's right.

235
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,750
Brother Dong has seen it all.

236
00:13:34,030 --> 00:13:34,390
Right?

237
00:13:35,080 --> 00:13:37,030
Find Brother Dong two pretty girls

238
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,030
to calm him.

239
00:13:39,000 --> 00:13:39,550
Come on, come on.

240
00:13:47,390 --> 00:13:49,080
Hello, Brother Dong.

241
00:14:04,360 --> 00:14:04,750
Bro.

242
00:14:05,030 --> 00:14:05,960
I haven't seen you here before.

243
00:14:08,750 --> 00:14:09,750
Why don't I pour you a drink?

244
00:14:10,200 --> 00:14:11,000
To booming business.

245
00:14:12,600 --> 00:14:13,030
Sounds good.

246
00:15:16,310 --> 00:15:18,370
♪I stand in a fire-tempered jungle♪

247
00:15:18,370 --> 00:15:20,320
♪Withered leaves fall
as my strength runs dry♪

248
00:15:20,320 --> 00:15:22,230
♪Dust swirls as I clench my fists♪

249
00:15:22,230 --> 00:15:24,030
♪I strategize, my faith my armor♪

250
00:15:24,030 --> 00:15:26,370
♪My defiance spills onto concrete♪

251
00:15:26,370 --> 00:15:28,800
♪Even thick fog can't hide
my clear gaze♪

252
00:15:31,940 --> 00:15:33,850
♪Let neon turn to thorns♪

253
00:15:33,850 --> 00:15:35,740
♪Flying low as the stars shift and turn♪

254
00:15:35,740 --> 00:15:37,690
♪Escape the maze,
transcend the challenge♪

255
00:15:37,690 --> 00:15:39,810
♪The meter starts, breaking the silence♪

256
00:15:39,850 --> 00:15:41,820
♪A beam cuts through
a crack in the wall♪

257
00:15:41,820 --> 00:15:43,980
♪This rhythm and noise
echo through the streets♪

258
00:15:47,580 --> 00:15:51,060
♪Don't be afraid. No one will answer♪

259
00:15:51,060 --> 00:15:54,430
♪Why is that child crying?♪

260
00:15:54,660 --> 00:15:57,130
♪The shrinking scar on my arm♪

261
00:15:57,130 --> 00:15:58,750
♪Means I've grown up♪

262
00:15:58,750 --> 00:16:01,900
♪You can trust me when I say that♪

263
00:16:01,900 --> 00:16:05,380
♪The wound still aches♪

264
00:16:05,790 --> 00:16:10,140
♪Like a biting winter♪

265
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:13,410
♪But a spark still glows♪

